        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-86183, 8 Inch Zeus Back-To-Back Door Handle Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe unique shape of the Zeus Solid Brass 8 Inch Back-to-Back Pull Set makes it a wonderful choice to show off your personal style. This modern door pull set comes packaged with everything you'll need to mount them back-to-back on a single door that is 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick. The 8 Inch Zeus Back-To-Back Door Handle Pair is available in several contemporary finish choices. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/zeus-8-inch-solid-brass-pull-emtek-86183\"><b>Zeus Pull with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Zeus Solid Brass Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\" x 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
